.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt JSON_PARSE_NUMBER 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm json_parse_number
.Nd parse a JSON number from a character buffer
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In json.h
.Ft int
.Fn json_parse_number "jsonval *val" "charbuf *b"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn json_parse_number
function parses a numeric token (integer or floating-point) from the character buffer
.Fa b
and stores the result into
.Fa val .
The value type in
.Fa val
is set to either
.Dv JSON_INT
or
.Dv JSON_DOUBLE
accordingly.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns 1 on success, 0 if no valid number was found, or a negative value on buffer error.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr json_read_tree 3